      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0f84c03fe039098c33d2d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6d8458e0d0c283a28cdf0b2904ed93a7dfbc7b68b667ed9ee61b5a7aaf69e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f4cdc3fdc43dcb811e50395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像可以获得这个哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccea6437e625a6fd7889953422ad077c98dec2a5533bc554b129368d7081cd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e1f5b54ed24f7765e35e90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎……对不起。\r\n我好像有点累了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b81c640c0768746af30556b24ca592d86ce90dcb3a91145270998b1c4174e1b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e98bb60396cc0bb7ebbfd770",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没事的……就是脚感觉有点沉重……\r\n或许休息一下会比较好～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5697a535212ade7ce38bda15e152f67ce305019ea145dcfa48b5da7a78e83160",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:331ff901d8dec6144f405eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道是不是因为昨天晚上\r\n重读了托儿所孩子们给我的信，\r\n我现在非～常有冲劲哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "617b59cfd2e506d5770aff9f0af29f8d30ff5c65b62c5c8b73d362404f0aedae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b94db1f2b37c886466eba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "觉得身体好轻盈哦。\r\n今天一定能比平常\r\n更开心地进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7f9564ac7399d88d91461915d399d72038a85f442779b4ee54fcf2e5ae68f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:255f92a2f8a1f26367c1830e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为今天状态非常好，\r\n我感觉可以抱着\r\n训练员跑步呢～呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "368d1b7ed93e3b27798bfdaba9baab7d43aae66af3ddbeb53b0f89f1b49d62bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efbcd98a56f5f252539a4b34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我充～满活力哦♪\r\n我会跑出好成绩让训练员笑开怀的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26ece62bd610bc4a85e27807abc3da6f0583af0b184431994f9f9a73a722001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e22611d8313f8ae9a288e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保持平常心才是最重要的呢～\r\n我们悠闲地度过吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8f34a99baadcaa951bc427fc0a5e44c1af8bc8f61ae6d4704002e14c883f251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a589bfbf4d433de445bb9cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经都准备好了哦～\r\n训练员准备好了吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae9af9b96022d075945da5f4e9826398552a154fd3464c4e378e841949fee64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2289b9c854936a318086761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～～哎～觉得肩膀好像很僵硬……\r\n明明每天都有在拉筋伸展的来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af93ddca0e5e4fe1f214a4ffb5abfa36791b48f0538f5c75b4c8f8a34866c42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02375a4e8e83d3fe9a27be85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽算不上充满活力，\r\n但只要是和训练员一起，\r\n就觉得还能继续努力哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf02755a5338c6f89078a1e5818c7c028029960a7f5ea7c75c46d085d621cf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bb9dfdfd8be7a66e9b180c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～怎么觉得状态好像有点……\r\n啊，你不用担心，我没问题的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e37bae5c3842b27afd1e2ccedc84c59b8000b6036360fcc97c187d08ffccf0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35c18364c9dcba19f2745167",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……怎么觉得好像很疲惫……\r\n真伤脑筋，该怎么办才好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5cd2681e5ef3e2bca6b543605ee9efcabbbcb9b37a9c1349d0f24cfb689196",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4ed59393ce557e016952a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，要参赛吗？\r\n最近一直连续在参赛呢～\r\n不知道能不能达到你的期望……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a6b3e60d5a0db36308e873ee6d8c5ed0f147eb5bb146803bfd89156106f4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15b45b8209390f9c2582e5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一直连续在比赛……\r\n休息也是很重要的哦～\r\n不要太过着急，慢慢来吧，好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52dde87d11d246b289590b023ebe7a4b51ae544fae1779d57696ff689fb3219c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c376cbb8b2d026487150846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，真不愧是训练员啊！\r\n状态调整的非常好呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d82b0f575a33155024fd3d0fa5140269502c95cc293d34fce4c202dfdd66b02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3ebff2097e9884c4a5b67c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是身体还是心理的状态都很好！\r\n剩下的就交给我吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d651168bf9d43b3b39f2a3d0ca7294f6e1de6401c31245b14bd3ffd096ce33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2dbbfb4c0211844c4e611a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～♪\r\n哎呀……不好意思，因为太期待\r\n比赛，不小心就哼着歌了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "497f2bcfab00d7ad4f2ac0619476fdbbe1c62e6254a6a763c101ca41685be1cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbfe369de0ad31af21c5ae93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才粉丝给了我鼓励的话哦。\r\n呵呵呵，我得好好努力才行了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec58f21379557c58d4b503fa731901db0bcdfca47c99a11e8e58e2a5be193fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "20026"
      ]
    }
  ]
